    [Misc][Quantization] Restrict quantization auto-detection to ModelSlim-only (#18199)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Simplifies `detect_quantization_method` /
    `maybe_auto_detect_quantization` to only auto-detect the ModelSlim
    format (via `quant_model_description.json`).
    
    The previous compressed-tensors/fp8 detection re-parsed `config.json`,
    which is redundant: upstream vLLM's `ModelConfig._verify_quantization`
    already resolves `quantization_config.quant_method` from `config.json`
    before `NPUPlatform.check_and_update_config` runs, so
    `model_config.quantization` is already set by then. ModelSlim is the
    only format whose signature (a standalone
    `quant_model_description.json`) upstream cannot detect, so it is the
    only case that needs Ascend-side detection.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    /nightly qwen3-30b-a3b-w8a8 Qwen3-30B-A3B-W4A8-llm-compressor --a3-560t
    
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    Signed-off-by: wangkunpeng <1289706727@qq.com>

